            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Nice catch, thanks for reporting this. Will be fixed by https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/42288\n\nNote: if you use ghostty or another terminal with an \"Undo\" feature, after closing the terminal window, the Nvim self-exit will take a few seconds (ghostty \"Undo\" keeps the process running temporarily in case you want to \"Undo\" the terminal-close).",
